===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The process of making [[map]]s.
# {{lb|en|biology}} The process of [[locating]] [[gene]]s on a [[chromosome]].
# {{lb|en|computing}} Assigning a [[PC]] to a shared drive or printer port on a network.
# {{lb|en|mathematics}} A [[function]] that [[map]]s every [[element]] of a given mathematical structure (eg: a [[set]]) to a [[unique]] element of another structure; a [[correspondence]].
# {{lb|en|object-oriented programming}} [[conversion]] of [[data type]]s between incompatible [[type system]]s.

